@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Native repository - approved batch transfer
actor Teacher
participant "Embedded chooser" as Browser
participant "Core repository AJAX" as Core
participant repository_multipicker as Repository
participant "Local draft_scope" as Scope
Teacher -> Browser : Import reviewed selection
Browser -> Core : Documented select_file callback and download
Core -> Core : Verify login / sesskey / sourcekey
Core -> Repository : Resolve batch source / check access
Repository -> Scope : Revalidate session scope and digest
Scope --> Repository : Actual draft, limits and current review
Core -> Repository : copy_to_area(native record)
Repository -> Scope : Check matching context and draft; apply
Scope --> Repository : Transactional copies / original attribution
Repository --> Core : Native draft response
Core --> Teacher : Close picker; refresh owning filemanager
@enduml
